{"id":1830322,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-19T19:47:10.502Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"},{"id":9648,"name":"Mystery"}],"homepage":"","id":1830322,"imdb_id":"tt1325758","origin_country":["HU"],"original_language":"hu","original_title":"Illúziók","overview":"The protagonist is an aging \"sky wanderer\" who flies alone through the blue sky in his biplane, living a solitary life of endless roaming and earning money only by taking people on sightseeing flights. His cynical worldview and nihilism stem from the conflict between his extensive theoretical knowledge about the human soul and fate and his far more limited life experience. He is a theoretical philosopher too lazy to write a book or even take notes, and deep down he feels his whole life is an escape from something that will eventually catch up with him. When he meets another sightseeing pilot who differs greatly from others he has known, their acquaintance grows into friendship and then a master-apprentice relationship, and over just six days together their lives are fundamentally changed.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/tpoLzhn9RCeOnj9IFHkznZ7zTWu.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":315654,"logo_path":null,"name":"Cruel World Team","origin_country":"HU"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Hungary"}],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":93,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Hungarian","iso_639_1":"hu","name":"Magyar"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Illúziók","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":231049,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Tibor Gáspár","original_name":"Gáspár Tibor","popularity":0.3573,"profile_path":"/qcbhA8ey9uJkOO6kMe0XtInEQTs.jpg","cast_id":9,"character":"","credit_id":"6afe6d33f4c12a105b4b0677","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1298840,"known_for_departm